---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Kreativ Sound"
  description="How Kreativ Sound handles analytics preferences, local browser data, purchases, contact details, and browser-based tool files."
  canonical="https://kreativsound.com/privacy/"
  activeNav=""
>
  <article class="card page-main policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Last updated October 17, 2026.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Who operates this site</h2>
      <p>Kreativ Sound is an independent sound-design project operated by Andrei Olaru. Privacy questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@kreativsound.com">info@kreativsound.com</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics and Cloudflare Web Analytics are optional on this website. They load only after you choose "Accept analytics." They may process information such as pages visited, approximate location, device and browser details, referral source, and interaction events.</p>
      <p>Your analytics preference is stored in your browser under <code>kreativ-analytics-consent</code>. If local storage is unavailable, the site uses a first-party preference cookie with the same name. You can change your choice at any time using the Privacy settings button in the footer. Declining analytics does not limit site functionality.</p>
      <p>Declining after acceptance reloads open Kreativ Sound pages to stop already-loaded tracking. Save or download unsaved tool work before changing your choice.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Local browser storage</h2>
      <p>The site stores your light or dark theme preference locally. Browser tools may store temporary settings or generated-session state locally so the interface can continue working in your browser. These values remain in your browser until you clear them.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Browser tools and files</h2>
      <p>Preset Mutator Free and Pro, Wave Mutator Free, and Pattern Mutator Free process source presets, audio, or MIDI locally in your browser. These files and generated outputs are not uploaded to Kreativ Sound by those workflows. Pro license verification is a separate online request, described below.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>License verification and activation</h2>
      <p>Preset Mutator Pro stores your activation key in this browser under <code>preset-mutator-pro-license</code>. Activation and automatic verification when Pro opens send the key and product identifier to Gumroad over HTTPS. Gumroad may return purchase status, an email address, and an order identifier so the tool can confirm access and display the license owner. Source presets and audio are not part of that request. Earlier signed activation tokens remain supported.</p>
      <p>KS BurnShaper uses one-time online activation, followed by saved offline activation. Its product-specific customer terms and activation/privacy notice are available on <a href="https://kreativ.gumroad.com/l/ks-burnshaper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gumroad</a> and included with the downloads. KS Ghostform requires no activation or license key.</p>
      <p>Clearing browser storage removes browser-tool settings and saved keys; you may need to activate again. Keep your purchase receipt and do not share keys publicly.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Purchases and external services</h2>
      <p>Current website purchases and product downloads are handled through Gumroad. Checkout and payment providers process payments and receipts under their own privacy policies; this website does not collect payment-card details directly. Kreativ Sound may receive purchase details such as your email address, product, transaction status, and license information. Records of historical PayPal purchases may still be used for support, refunds, accounting, or legal obligations.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Embedded music players</h2>
      <p>The Music page uses Bandcamp players. Loading a player connects your browser to Bandcamp, which may receive your IP address, browser information, and player activity under <a href="https://bandcamp.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bandcamp's privacy policy</a>. The featured player can load when it enters view; other players load when you choose Listen here.</p>
      <p>These external players are separate from optional Kreativ Sound analytics. Declining our analytics does not block Bandcamp connections or control Bandcamp's own privacy settings. You can use the direct Bandcamp links instead of opening an on-page player.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact and retention</h2>
      <p>If you email Kreativ Sound, your message and contact details are used to answer the request and maintain relevant support or transaction records. Data is kept only as long as reasonably necessary for support, accounting, fraud prevention, or legal obligations.</p>
      <p>The contact form sends your name, email address, selected product, message, and any optional system details to FormSubmit for forwarding to Kreativ Sound. FormSubmit provides a spam check using Google reCAPTCHA and retains submissions for 30 days. See <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit’s privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s privacy policy</a>. You can email us directly instead. Please do not include passwords, payment details, or other sensitive information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You may ask about, correct, or request deletion of personal information held directly by Kreativ Sound, subject to legal recordkeeping requirements. Contact <a href="mailto:info@kreativsound.com">info@kreativsound.com</a> with the email address connected to your request.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
